{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-18T20:25:48.818Z","data":{"text":"Task 3 complete. Summary:\n\n**Implemented `--dev` reactive dev mode:**\n\n- **`src/watcher/dev.ts`** (new) — `runDevSupervisor` runs the watcher as a `tsx` child (`--import tsx <root>/src/cli/bin.ts watch …`) with `OSQ_DEV_WORKER=1`, watches `src/` via chokidar (`ignoreInitial: true`), sends `SIGINT` on a source change so the worker finishes its active task before exiting, then respawns fresh code. Repeated changes coalesce; user `SIGINT` kills the worker and exits `130` without restart; missing `src/` logs one line and exits `1`. `buildWorkerInvocation` is exported and `--dev` is not forwarded.\n- **`src/cli/watch.ts`** — added `dev?` to `WatchCommandOptions`, `shouldRunDevSupervisor()` guard (`dev && OSQ_DEV_WORKER !== '1'`), and dynamic delegation to the supervisor.\n- **`src/cli/index.ts`** — `watch` registers `--dev` and forwards it.\n- **Tests** — new `tests/watcher-dev.test.ts` (7 tests: tsx/src invocation, guard, watch dir, graceful finish-then-restart, coalescing, SIGINT/no-restart, missing src) plus a `--dev` registration assertion in `tests/watcher.test.ts`.\n\n**Verification:** `node --import tsx --test tests/watcher-dev.test.ts` 7/7 pass; `pnpm tsc --noEmit`, `pnpm test` (471 tests), `pnpm lint` all green. Result written to `openspec/changes/020-watcher-stale-build-detection/.run/results/3.md`."}}
